      "content": "it's still feeling really sharp and that nausea is getting worse, almost like i might throw up. i'm also starting to feel a bit sweaty and clammy. i really can't afford a hospital visit right now, it would ruin me financially. since the ibuprofen isn't quite hitting it, can i just take some extra strength aspirin along with the high dose of ibuprofen? i read online that combining them can help with severe pain. would that be a better way to manage this at home?",
